{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>Half the district</b> — like the sense of מחוז. And the Aramaic translation of שלשת הנפת (Joshua 12:3): תלתא פלכין לנפת — three districts for the circuit. דור אחד לפלך — one circuit per district. דור חד."], :book :nehemiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {0 "The last two phrases appear to be Aramaic translations of the words דור אחד (a gloss on לפלך) and דור (a gloss on חד); their exact relationship to the preceding is unclear, so they are rendered hyper-literally in sequence."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Nehemiah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/nechemya"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:14:56.423295522Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}